From: debforge-kernel
Subject: resolve_btfids: tag kfuncs itself (backport from Linux 7.3)

pahole --btf_features=decl_tag_kfuncs leaves some kfuncs without the
"bpf_kfunc" decl tag on 7.2, so KF_IMPLICIT_ARGS kfuncs such as
scx_bpf_kick_cpu keep their implicit argument in vmlinux BTF and sched_ext
schedulers fail to load. Linux 7.3 fixed this by having resolve_btfids
discover kfuncs from the BTF ID sets and emit the decl tags itself.

This is that upstream series, squashed, unchanged, on top of 7.2 (selftests and docs left out):

  1dbf26eca0a4 tools/bpf: Sync btf_ids.h to tools
  ef242559eb48 libbpf: Export btf__find_by_name_kind_own()
  47d62db55043 resolve_btfids: Implement generic ensure_mem() to grow arrays
  c5ab68a5fa92 resolve_btfids: Index BTF ID symbols by address
  e4293c31a320 resolve_btfids: Keep collected kfuncs in a rbtree
  91efe50e3042 resolve_btfids: Fix the _impl lookup for module BTF
  5c4923172dae HID: bpf: Make syscall kfunc flags match the struct_ops set
  f9f60d41ba2c resolve_btfids: Discover kfuncs from BTF ID sets
  140a3479ef66 resolve_btfids: Enforce consistent kfunc flags across BTF ID sets
  3d72aca40b83 resolve_btfids: Deduplicate BTF after btf2btf transformations
  27a78c2e7eee resolve_btfids: Process KF_ARENA_* flags in resolve_btfids
  692393104909 resolve_btfids: Emit bpf_kfunc and bpf_fastcall decl tags

